  "build_note": "Source-built from the pinned sdist with maturin --locked and Rust -C instrument-coverage -C codegen-units=1 plus release debug info, keeping the sdist's fat-LTO release profile. The official aarch64 cp311 wheel builds the same sources without coverage instrumentation.",
  "dependencies_note": "rtoml has no Python runtime dependencies; maturin 1.16.0 is the build backend only. The parser crates come from crates.io through the sdist Cargo.lock, and cargo checks their checksums.",
  "parser_family": "toml_parser (toml-rs, Rust): rtoml's PyO3 _rtoml module calls toml::Deserializer::parse (toml 1.1.8), which lexes and parses through toml_parser 1.1.5 and assembles DeTable/DeValue from its events; rtoml's own src/de.rs turns that into Python objects. Same parser family as the selected Rust toml and toml_edit paths (the same toml_parser 1.1.5 release); independent of tomli/tomllib and tomlkit.",
